{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"feb08b9a448a6d8849ead791b305b99aa373ff61cc0aae0e1cd0cc54993789dc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「那日，必给大卫家和耶路撒冷的居民开一个泉源，洗除罪恶与污秽。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["万军之耶和华说：「那日，我必从地上除灭偶像的名，不再被人记念；也必使这地不再有假先知与污秽的灵。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["若再有人说预言，生他的父母必对他说：『你不得存活，因为你托耶和华的名说假预言。』生他的父母在他说预言的时候，要将他刺透。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["那日，凡作先知说预言的必因他所论的异象羞愧，不再穿毛衣哄骗人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他必说：『我不是先知，我是耕地的；我从幼年作人的奴仆。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["必有人问他说：『你两臂中间是什么伤呢？』他必回答说：『这是我在亲友家中所受的伤。』」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["牧人被杀"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"万军之耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀剑哪，应当兴起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻击我的牧人和我的同伴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"击打牧人，羊就分散；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必反手加在微小者的身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：这全地的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"三分之二必剪除而死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"三分之一仍必存留。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使这三分之一经火，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"熬炼他们，如熬炼银子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"试炼他们，如试炼金子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必求告我的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必应允他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要说：这是我的子民。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们也要说：耶和华是我们的 神。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}